# Trial profile: cyankiwi/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-BF16-INT4 (compressed-tensors
# W4A16, group-32 asymmetric, pack-quantized; GDN + vision + lm_head left
# unquantized, bf16 activations).
# Cloned from env/qwen3.8-27b.env with three deliberate differences:
#  - fp8 KV with calibrated scales: VLLM_MODEL_ID + a local VLLM_MODEL copy
#    carrying model-kvscales.safetensors (built by tools/setup_kvscales.py +
#    tools/calibrate_kv_scales.py; `just up` skips once the sidecar exists).
#    Recalibration is a manual two-step: `just clear-kvscales` re-runs setup,
#    then the local config.json symlink MUST be replaced with the
#    VLLM_HF_CONFIG_PATH snapshot content (the calibrator enables MTP so the
#    head layers exist, and without the "-:mtp" dynamic key it hits the
#    #53387 drafter crash). Bootstrap rule from the calibrator header holds:
#    calibrate on a fresh copy whose index has no sidecar refs yet.
#  - model/tokenizer point at the HF id directly (public, ~28.9 GB download).
#  - MTP3 via a local HF-config snapshot (VLLM_HF_CONFIG_PATH): the
#    checkpoint ships unquantized mtp.* with no `dynamic` exclusions, which
#    crashes the MTP drafter at load (upstream #53387, still OPEN — target
#    loads fine, only the drafter fails). The snapshot is a verbatim copy of
#    the upstream config.json plus a GPTQ-style `"-:mtp"` entry in
#    quantization_config.dynamic, which is the escape hatch
#    qwen3_5_mtp.py checks to build the drafter unquantized. The
#    compressed-tensors target loader never reads that key (verified: only
#    auto_gptq.py and the mtp model code reference it), so target loading is
#    unaffected. No rebuild needed. Refresh the snapshot if the upstream
#    checkpoint revs its config; drop it when a pinned VLLM_REF contains the
#    #53387 fix.
# Everything else mirrors the live qwen3.8-27b profile (2026-09-23: MTP off,
# seqs 8, chunk 1024, 128k) so bench numbers compare 1:1 — model swap only,
# plus a higher mem-util (0.97) for the smaller AWQ weights.
VLLM_MODEL_ID=cyankiwi/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-BF16-INT4
VLLM_MODEL=/home/philip/models-local/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-BF16-INT4-kvscales
VLLM_TOKENIZER=cyankiwi/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-BF16-INT4
VLLM_SERVED_NAME=qwen3.8-27b
# 0.97 (AWQ weights are ~10.3 GiB, so the KV pool can take more than the
# live profile's 0.95). Lower to 0.92 if a GPU co-tenant is active
# (e.g. whisper.cpp Vulkan on GPU0); see compose.yaml.
VLLM_GPU_MEM_UTIL=0.97
VLLM_MAX_MODEL_LEN=131072
# fp8 KV cache with calibrated scales (see header). Fall back to bf16 KV
# only if coherence/recall diverges.
VLLM_KV_CACHE_DTYPE=fp8
# 8 concurrent sequences, mirroring the live profile (2026-09-23
# throughput-first setup, MTP off so #35288/#55533 are out of scope).
VLLM_MAX_NUM_SEQS=8
# Chunk 1024 (2026-09-23 A/B vs 2048 on this profile: 2048 gives +1.5%
# pp2048 and -6% big-prefill TTFT (75.5s -> 71.0s @113k) but ~2x co-decode
# stall (p50 480 -> 942ms, p99 887 -> 1348ms, choke 32x -> 49x). Same call
# as live: smoothness over raw TTFT.)
VLLM_MAX_BATCHED_TOKENS=1024
# Spec-decode DISABLED (2026-09-23, mirroring live): empty means compose.yaml
# passes no --speculative-config and no --no-async-scheduling, so async
# scheduling re-enables (decode gap overlap).
# Prior MTP3 record kept for rollback: MTP3 needed the VLLM_HF_CONFIG_PATH
# snapshot below (the #53387 drafter escape hatch — trialled MTP4 2026-09-13
# and reverted: 4th position accepted at only ~37%, mean accepted length
# 3.67 -> ~3.2, no tg gain. DFlash2 rejected: see archive/DEADENDS.md).
# ROLLBACK: '{"method": "mtp", "num_speculative_tokens": 3, "attention_backend": "ROCM_AITER_UNIFIED_ATTN"}'
VLLM_SPEC_DECODE=
# Local HF-config snapshot (verbatim upstream config.json + "-:mtp" dynamic
# exclusion) — only needed for the MTP drafter (#53387 hatch). Unset while
# spec decode is off so the target loads its own config; re-set on rollback
# to MTP alongside VLLM_SPEC_DECODE above.
# VLLM_HF_CONFIG_PATH=/home/philip/r9700-serving/hf-configs/qwen3.8-27b-awq
# v0.29.0 (#55760 + #55861) defaults prefix_cache_retention_interval to dense
# (None) for hybrid GDN + MTP/EAGLE — same as the live profile (unset here).
# PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL=1600
# Force V2 model runner (same as the live profile, 2026-09-09): V1 has the
# M-RoPE draft-slot bug #54498 (prompt KV overwrite on image+MTP).
VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1
